      "question": "If x = (&radic;6 + 2) and y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2), then what is the value of ( x _________ y + y _________ x )( x _________ y + y _________ x ) - 3 &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = (&radic;6 + 2) &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;( x _________ y + y _________ x )( x _________ y + y _________ x ) - 3",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x = (&radic;6 + 2) and y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2), then what is the value of (&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">y</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">y</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;)(&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">y</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">y</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;) - 3&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = (&radic;6 + 2) &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;(&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">y</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">y</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;)(&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">y</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">y</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">x</span></div>&nbsp;) - 3&nbsp;</div></div></p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "42 42",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">42</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">42</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
