          "id": "D",
          "text": "22 22",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">22</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Compute x/y:</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by (&radic;6 + 2):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y = ( (&radic;6 + 2)&#178; ) / ( (&radic;6)&#178; &#8722; 2&#178; )</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (6 + 4&radic;6 + 4) / (6 &#8722; 4)</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (10 + 4&radic;6) / 2 = 5 + 2&radic;6.</p><p>Similarly, compute y/x:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;y/x = 5 &#8722; 2&radic;6.</p><p>Sum the two:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y + y/x = (5 + 2&radic;6) + (5 &#8722; 2&radic;6) = 10.</p><p>Then, (x/y + y/x)&#178; &#8722; 3 = 10&#178; &#8722; 3 = 100 &#8722; 3 = 97.</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>",
