      "question": "a 7 b 8 c 7 _________ a 9 b 5 c 4 in simplified form is: a 7 b 8 c 7 _________ a 9 b 5 c 4 &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>7</sup>  b<sup>8</sup>  c<sup>7</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a<sup>9</sup> b<sup>5</sup> c<sup>4</sup></span></div>&nbsp;in simplified form is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>7</sup>  b<sup>8</sup>  c<sup>7</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a<sup>9</sup> b<sup>5</sup> c<sup>4</sup></span></div>&nbsp;&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "(a 0 ) X (b 2 ) X (c 1 ) (a 0 ) X (b 2 ) X (c 1 )",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">(a<sup>0</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>1</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(a<sup>0</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>1</sup>)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "(a -7 ) X (b 2 ) X (c -4 ) (a -7 ) X (b 2 ) X (c -4 )",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">(a<sup>-7</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(a<sup>-7</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "(a -2 ) X (b 3 ) X (c 3 ) (a -2 ) X (b 3 ) X (c 3 )",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">(a<sup>-2</sup>)  X  (b<sup>3</sup>)  X  (c<sup>3</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(a<sup>-2</sup>)  X  (b<sup>3</sup>)  X  (c<sup>3</sup>)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "(a -5 ) X (b -8 ) X (c 0 ) (a -5 ) X (b -8 ) X (c 0 )",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">(a<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-8</sup>)  X  (c<sup>0</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(a<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-8</sup>)  X  (c<sup>0</sup>)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>We need to simplify the expression (a<sup>7</sup>  X  b<sup>8</sup>  X  c<sup>7</sup>)/(a<sup>9</sup>  X  b<sup>5</sup> X  c<sup>4</sup>). Using the exponent rule for division, when dividing terms with the same base, subtract the exponents:</p><p>For a: a<sup>7</sup> / a<sup>9</sup> = a<sup>(7-9)</sup> = a<sup>-2</sup></p><p>For b: b<sup>8</sup> / b<sup>5</sup> = b<sup>(8 - 5)</sup> = b<sup>3</sup></p><p>For c: c<sup>7</sup> / c<sup>4</sup> = c<sup>(7 - 4)</sup> = c<sup>3</sup></p><p>So, the expression becomes:</p><p>a<sup>-2</sup>  X  b<sup>3</sup>  X  c<sup>3</sup></p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>",
