      "question": "If 2 x + 3 y = 17 and 2 x+2 - 3 y+1 = 5, then: &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2 x + 3 y = 17 &#2324;&#2352; 2 x+2 - 3 y+1 = 5 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2<sup>x</sup>+ 3<sup>y</sup> = 17 and 2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5, then:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2<sup>x</sup>+ 3<sup>y</sup> = 17 &#2324;&#2352; 2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "x = 1, y = 3 x = 1, y = 3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">x = 1, y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 1, y = 3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "x = 3, y = 3 x = 3, y = 3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">x = 3, y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 3, y = 3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "x = 3, y = 2 x = 3, y = 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">x = 3, y = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 3, y = 2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "x = 1, y = 2 x = 1, y = 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">x = 1, y = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x = 1, y = 2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5</p><p>2<sup>x </sup>*2<sup>2</sup> - 3<sup>y</sup>*3<sup>1</sup> = 5</p><p>4*2<sup>x</sup>  -  3*3<sup>y</sup> = 5 ---------(1)</p><p>and 2<sup>x</sup> + 3<sup>y</sup> = 17----------(2)</p><p>On solving equation (1) and (2) -</p><p>2<sup>x</sup> = 8 = 2<sup>3</sup>&rarr; x = 3</p><p>3<sup>y</sup> = 9 = 3<sup>2</sup>&rarr; y = 2</p>",
